C92E B7FF23           (adybug/src/main.s):01638                 sta     PIA2_CRB
C931 8680             (adybug/src/main.s):01639                 lda     #$80            ; centre DAC while idle
C933 B7FF20           (adybug/src/main.s):01640                 sta     PIA2_DA
